Nếu chọn HƯỚNG 2 (Enterprise Pattern) thì hãy bỏ hoàn toàn ý tưởng:

```text
 result('Try')
 → tìm Scope lỗi
 → gọi result() tiếp
 ```

Thay vào đó:

```text
 Try
 ├─ Scope_1
 ├─ Scope_2
 ├─ Scope_3
 └─ Scope_N

Catch
 └─ Đọc ErrorLogs
 ```

Mỗi Scope có trách nhiệm tự ghi lỗi của nó.

---

# 1. Initialize Variables

## ErrorLogs

Type:

```text
 Array
 ```

Value:

```json
 []
 ```

---

# 2. Scope_1

```text
 Scope_1
 ├─ Get Item
 ├─ Update Item
 └─ Scope_1_ErrorHandler
 ```

## Scope_1_ErrorHandler

Run After của Scope_1_ErrorHandler:

```text
 Scope_1

☐ Is successful
 ☑ Has failed
 ☐ Is skipped
 ☑ Has timed out
 ```

---

### Filter Action Failed

From:

```text
 result('Scope_1')
 ```

Condition:

```text
 @equals(item()?['status'],'Failed')
 ```

---

### Append to array variable

Tên biến:

```text
 ErrorLogs
 ```

Value:

```json
 {
 "Scope": "Scope_1",
 "Action": "@{first(body('Filter_Action_Failed_Scope1'))?['name']}",
 "Code": "@{first(body('Filter_Action_Failed_Scope1'))?['error']?['code']}",
 "Message": "@{first(body('Filter_Action_Failed_Scope1'))?['error']?['message']}",
 "Time": "@{utcNow()}"
 }
 ```

---

